  "comment": {
    "text": "Small hint under the \"Don't ask again on this device\" checkbox in the passphrase unlock dialog for end-to-end encrypted private rooms. Says that the unlocked encryption key stays on this computer even when the session auto-locks, for at most 30 days, and warns against ticking the box on a shared computer. 'Auto-lock' is the automatic locking after inactivity or when the tab is hidden.",
    "is_auto": true,
